# Build-time configuration for a real deploy. Copy to .env.production and fill in.
# NO secrets belong here - these are public client-side values. Anything secret lives on the server.
# Leave VITE_DEMO_MODE unset: `vite build` is then demo-free automatically.
# Keys: VITE_DEMO_MODE, VITE_ENGINE_BASE_URL, VITE_AUTH_BASE_URL, VITE_BILLING_BASE_URL,
#       VITE_ACCOUNT_BASE_URL, VITE_PAYMENT_LINK_URL, VITE_DISCORD_INVITE_URL
# (Listed as a comment so the AI Studio preview does not demand values; the preview is a demo build.)
